            "raw_content_1": "<p>This BB Creme is made with skin-safe ingredients chosen to sit comfortably on mature, sensitive skin and wear evenly throughout the day.</p><p>There are no sulfates or parabens. All ingredients are cruelty-free.</p><h3><strong>Full ingredient list</strong></h3><p>Ingredients may vary slightly by shade.</p><p><strong>Fair:</strong></p><p>Aqua (Water), Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Coconut Alkanes, Talc, Butylene Glycol, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Isononyl Isononanoate, Silica, Squalane, Disteardimonium Hectorite, HDI/Trimethylol Hexyllactone Crosspolymer, Isododecane, Cetyl Diglyceryl Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)silylethyl Dimethicone, Glycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Hydrogen Dimethicone, Dimethiconol, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Shea Butter (Butyrospermum Parkii), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Terminalia Ferdinandiana Fruit Extract, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Aluminum Hydroxide, Hyaluronic Acid, Tropolone, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate</p><p><strong>Light / Light-Medium / Tan:</strong></p><p>Same base formula with adjusted mineral pigments for shade matching.</p><h3><strong>What’s inside (in plain language)</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Hydration support<br/></strong>Ingredients like glycerin and hyaluronic acid help keep skin from feeling tight or dry during wear.</li><li><strong>Skin-softening oils and emollients<br/></strong>Squalane, coconut-derived alkanes, and shea butter help the product spread smoothly and reduce the look of dryness or texture.</li><li><strong>Mineral pigments for even tone<br/></strong>Titanium dioxide and iron oxides help even out redness and discoloration without covering natural skin.</li><li><strong>Lightweight texture ingredients<br/></strong>Silica and talc help keep the finish balanced, so skin doesn’t look greasy or overly matte.</li></ul><p><strong>Stability and preservation</strong>Used in low amounts to keep the formula safe, fresh, and suitable for daily use.<br/><br/></p>",
            "title_2": "BENEFITS",
            "raw_content_2": "<p><strong>&gt; Evens Tone Without Hiding Your Skin</strong></p><p>Helps reduce redness and uneven areas while freckles and natural texture stay visible.</p><p><strong>&gt; Wears Evenly As the Day Goes On</strong></p><p>Holds together instead of separating, patching, or breaking up around the nose and mouth.</p><p><strong>&gt; Comfortable on Mature, Sensitive Skin</strong></p><p>Designed to avoid that tight, dry feeling that can show up a few hours after application.</p><p><strong>&gt; Easy to Apply Without Precision Tools</strong></p><p>Spreads smoothly with fingers or a brush without pulling at the skin.</p><p><strong>&gt; Made With Skin-Safe Ingredients </strong></p><p>Formulated without sulfates or parabens, using ingredients chosen to sit calmly on aging skin.</p><p><strong>&gt; Created by Licensed Esthetician Nikol Johnson-Sanchez</strong></p><p>Developed by someone who works hands-on with mature skin every day, not in a lab testing on twenty-year-olds.</p>",
            "title_3": "SHIPPING & RETURNS",
            "raw_content_3": "<p>Orders ship via <strong>USPS</strong> within the United States and to <strong>Canada</strong>.</p><p>U.S. orders typically arrive in <strong>5–7 business days</strong>. Canadian orders may take <strong>10–20 days</strong>.</p><p>You’ll receive an <strong>email confirmation</strong> after placing your order, and a text message if you’ve signed up for SMS alerts.</p><p>All sales are <strong>final</strong>. If an item arrives damaged, please contact our support team within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> and include photos of the issue along with your invoice so we can assist.<br/><br/></p>",
            "title_4": "",
            "raw_content_4": "",
            "title_5": "",
            "raw_content_5": "",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
